    {
      "type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions",
      "notes": "Usage: Take 2 tablets 1 or 2 times per day, preferably with meals or as directed by your qualified healthcare professional."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications",
      "notes": "Note: If you have a medical condition, are pregnant, lactating, trying to conceive, under the age of 18, or taking medications, consult your healthcare professional before using this product."
